  "name": "Women and Equalities Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The Women and Equalities Committee examines the work of the Office for Equality and Opportunity (OEO). It holds Government to account on equality law and policy, including the Equality Act 2010 and cross Government activity on equalities. It also scrutinises the Equality and Human Rights Commission.</p>\r\n<p>Follow us on social media: <u><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/hoccommittees.parliament.uk\">Bluesky</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61579513151155\">Facebook</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ukcommonscommittees\">Instagram</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/house-of-commons-committees\">LinkedIn</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/UKCommonsCommittees/\">Reddit</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLj3mInRJqIekxA--aDW780T_TUCwjea4M\">YouTube</a></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p><u>Sign up to the weekly <a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/email/committeecorridor\">cross-committee newsletter, ‘Committee Corridor</a>.</u></p>",
